# An M-VAVE SMC-Mixer on MIDI IN (Notes: SMC, 2026-11-14), as the maker's sends: control changes on channel 1. The faders (CC 40-47) are the tracks'
# levels, each strip's top button (20-27) its track's mute, a knob (34) the mood (a button on the same number, 127 then 0, is not a turn), the bottom
# row stop (60), play (61) and START SET (62). The mode is kept through a power cycle.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect playing 1
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 8
wait 100
expect fxpage 26
spin K1 4
wait 200
expect minpads 4
shot midiin_smc.png
tap FX
wait 300
# fader 1 (the kick) to the top, then the middle; fader 2 (the hats, closed and open) to the bottom; fader 8 (the pluck) to the top
midi B0 28 7F
wait 100
expect par49 100
midi B0 28 40
wait 100
expect par49 50
midi B0 29 00
wait 100
expect par58 0
expect par61 0
midi B0 2F 7F
wait 100
expect par98 100
# strip 1's top button: the kick muted, and again: back; strip 8's: the pluck
midi B0 14 7F
midi B0 14 00
wait 100
expect trkmute 1
midi B0 14 7F
midi B0 14 00
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
midi B0 1B 7F
midi B0 1B 00
wait 100
expect trkmute 128
midi B0 1B 7F
midi B0 1B 00
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
# the knob on 34: the mood; strip 7's second button sends 34 too (127, then 0): not a turn
midi B0 22 40
wait 100
expect mood 50
midi B0 22 7F
midi B0 22 00
wait 100
expect mood 50
midi B0 22 42
wait 100
expect mood 52
# the bottom row: stop, play, START SET (the auto-DJ on)
midi B0 3C 7F
midi B0 3C 00
wait 300
expect playing 0
midi B0 3D 7F
midi B0 3D 00
wait 300
expect playing 1
expect djon 0
midi B0 3E 7F
midi B0 3E 00
wait 1500
expect djon 1
expect playing 1
wait 9000
reboot
wait 3000
expect minpads 4
